function mapSelectorBodyHtml(){const racks=racksOptions(),layout=rackMapLayout(racks),locs=locationsForRackIds(),selectedCount=[...mapSelectedLocationIds].filter(id=>!isQueuedKey(`UBICACION:${id}`)).length;return `<div class="label-map-layout"><div class="label-map-side"><div class="label-map-summary"><span class="eyebrow">SELECCIÓN VISUAL</span><h3>${mapSelectedRackIds.size} rack${mapSelectedRackIds.size===1?'':'s'} · ${selectedCount} posición${selectedCount===1?'':'es'} nueva${selectedCount===1?'':'s'}</h3><small>Toca un rack para cargar todas sus posiciones. Las que ya están en la cola quedan bloqueadas para evitar duplicados.</small></div><div class="label-rack-map">${racks.map(r=>{const slot=layout[r.id]||{x:5,y:5,w:6,h:20},rackLocs=(store.data.locations||[]).filter(l=>l.siteId===activeSiteId()&&l.active!==false&&l.rackId===r.id),queued=rackLocs.filter(l=>isQueuedKey(`UBICACION:${l.id}`)).length,available=rackLocs.length-queued,selected=mapSelectedRackIds.has(r.id);return `<button type="button" class="label-map-rack ${selected?'is-selected':''} ${available===0&&rackLocs.length?'is-complete':''}" data-label-map-rack="${esc(r.id)}" style="left:${Number(slot.x)||0}%;top:${Number(slot.y)||0}%;width:${Math.max(3,Number(slot.w)||5)}%;height:${Math.max(5,Number(slot.h)||18)}%" ${available===0&&rackLocs.length?'disabled':''}><b>${esc(rackMapKey(r))}</b><small>${available===0&&rackLocs.length?'✓':`${available}/${rackLocs.length}`}</small></button>`;}).join('')}</div><div class="label-map-actions"><button id="label-map-clear" class="ghost" type="button" ${mapSelectedRackIds.size?'':'disabled'}>Limpiar selección</button><button id="label-map-add" class="primary" type="button" ${selectedCount?'':'disabled'}>Agregar ${selectedCount} a impresión</button></div></div><div class="label-map-positions"><div class="label-map-positions-head"><div><b>Posiciones del rack</b><small>${locs.length?`${selectedCount} nuevas seleccionadas`:'Selecciona un rack en el mapa.'}</small></div>${locs.length?`<button id="label-map-toggle-all" class="ghost" type="button">Alternar disponibles</button>`:''}</div><div class="label-map-position-list">${locs.length?locs.map(l=>{const code=scannableLocation(l),queued=isQueuedKey(`UBICACION:${l.id}`),checked=!queued&&mapSelectedLocationIds.has(l.id);return `<label class="label-map-position-row ${queued?'is-in-queue':''}"><input class="label-map-location-check" type="checkbox" value="${esc(l.id)}" ${checked?'checked':''} ${queued?'disabled':''}><span><b>${esc(code)}</b><small>${esc(l.label||l.id)} · ${esc(rack(l.rackId)?.name||l.rackId||'Rack')}${queued?' · ✓ Ya en cola':''}</small></span></label>`;}).join(''):`<div class="label-map-empty">Toca cualquier rack del centro para cargar sus posiciones.</div>`}</div></div></div>`;}
function ensureMapSelector(){let dlg=document.querySelector('#labels-map-selector');if(!dlg){document.body.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<dialog id="labels-map-selector" class="label-map-dialog"><div class="label-map-card"><div class="dialog-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ETIQUETAS DESDE MAPA</span><h3>Seleccionar racks y posiciones</h3><small>Selecciona el rack y Khal cargará sus posiciones físicas para agregarlas a la cola.</small></div><button id="labels-map-close" class="ghost" type="button">×</button></div><div id="labels-map-body"></div></div></dialog>`);dlg=document.querySelector('#labels-map-selector');}return dlg;}
function paintMapSelector(root){const dlg=ensureMapSelector(),body=dlg.querySelector('#labels-map-body');mapSelectedLocationIds=new Set([...mapSelectedLocationIds].filter(id=>!isQueuedKey(`UBICACION:${id}`)));body.innerHTML=mapSelectorBodyHtml();body.querySelectorAll('[data-label-map-rack]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{const id=btn.dataset.labelMapRack,rackLocs=(store.data.locations||[]).filter(l=>l.siteId===activeSiteId()&&l.active!==false&&l.rackId===id&&!isQueuedKey(`UBICACION:${l.id}`));if(mapSelectedRackIds.has(id)){mapSelectedRackIds.delete(id);rackLocs.forEach(l=>mapSelectedLocationIds.delete(l.id));}else{mapSelectedRackIds.add(id);rackLocs.forEach(l=>mapSelectedLocationIds.add(l.id));}paintMapSelector(root);});body.querySelectorAll('.label-map-location-check').forEach(ch=>ch.onchange=()=>{if(ch.disabled)return;if(ch.checked)mapSelectedLocationIds.add(ch.value);else mapSelectedLocationIds.delete(ch.value);paintMapSelector(root);});body.querySelector('#label-map-clear')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{mapSelectedRackIds=new Set();mapSelectedLocationIds=new Set();paintMapSelector(root);});body.querySelector('#label-map-toggle-all')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const locs=locationsForRackIds().filter(l=>!isQueuedKey(`UBICACION:${l.id}`)),all=locs.length&&locs.every(l=>mapSelectedLocationIds.has(l.id));locs.forEach(l=>all?mapSelectedLocationIds.delete(l.id):mapSelectedLocationIds.add(l.id));paintMapSelector(root);});body.querySelector('#label-map-add')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const selected=new Set([...mapSelectedLocationIds].filter(id=>!isQueuedKey(`UBICACION:${id}`))),rows=locationRows().filter(r=>selected.has(r.meta.locationId)),added=rows.filter(item=>addItem(item)).length;mapSelectedLocationIds=new Set();mapSelectedRackIds=new Set();renderDynamic(root);dlg.close();toast(`${added} posición${added===1?'':'es'} nueva${added===1?'':'s'} agregada${added===1?'':'s'} a impresión`,'success');setTimeout(()=>document.querySelector('.label-queue-panel')?.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'}),80);});}
function openMapSelector(root){const dlg=ensureMapSelector();paintMapSelector(root);dlg.querySelector('#labels-map-close').onclick=()=>dlg.close();dlg.showModal();}
function filtersHtml(){
  const racks=racksOptions(),mods=modulesOptions(),operatorMode=isWarehouseOperator();
  const searchLabel=labelType==='PRODUCTO'?'Producto / SKU / código':'Código / búsqueda';
  const searchPlaceholder=labelType==='PRODUCTO'?'Escanea o escribe SKU, código o nombre':'Escanea o escribe código, nombre o ubicación';
  const typeControl=`<label class="label-type-control">Tipo de etiqueta<select id="label-type"><option value="PRODUCTO">Producto</option><option value="UBICACION">Ubicación / posición</option><option value="RACK">Rack</option><option value="PALLET">Pallet</option><option value="MANUAL">Código manual</option></select></label>`;
  const searchControl=`<label class="label-search-control">${searchLabel}<div class="entrada-con-camara label-search-actions"><input id="label-search" value="${esc(searchText)}" placeholder="${searchPlaceholder}" autocomplete="off" inputmode="text" ${labelType==='MANUAL'?'disabled':''}><button id="label-search-keyboard" class="numeric-keyboard-button" type="button" title="Teclado numérico" ${labelType==='MANUAL'?'disabled':''}>123</button><button id="label-search-camera" class="scan-button" type="button" title="Escanear con cámara" aria-label="Escanear con cámara" ${labelType==='MANUAL'?'disabled':''}>▣</button></div></label>`;
  const formatControl=`<label>Formato estándar<div class="label-fixed-format">${esc(SIZE_MAP[TYPE_SIZE_DEFAULTS[labelType]||'100x70'].label)}</div></label>`;
  const darknessControl=`<label class="label-darkness-main">Oscuridad Zebra <span id="label-darkness-value">${zebraDarkness} / 30</span><input id="label-zebra-darkness" type="range" min="28" max="30" step="1" value="${zebraDarkness}" aria-label="Oscuridad Zebra"><small>Impresión Zebra automática</small></label>`;
  const limits=verticalOffsetLimits();
  const operatorPrintSettings=operatorMode?`<details class="label-operator-calibration"><summary>⚙ Ajustes de impresión <span>Posición vertical · Oscuridad</span></summary><div class="label-operator-calibration-body"><label>Posición vertical <b id="label-offset-value">${labelVerticalOffsetMm>0?'+':''}${labelVerticalOffsetMm} mm</b><input id="label-vertical-offset" type="range" min="${limits.min}" max="${limits.max}" step="1" value="${labelVerticalOffsetMm}" aria-label="Posición vertical Zebra"><small>${isPhysicalLabelType()?'Rack / posición':'Producto / pallet'} · ajuste independiente</small></label><label>Oscuridad <b id="label-darkness-value">${zebraDarkness} / 30</b><input id="label-zebra-darkness" type="range" min="28" max="30" step="1" value="${zebraDarkness}" aria-label="Oscuridad Zebra"><small>Alta por defecto</small></label><button id="label-calibration-reset" class="ghost" type="button">Restablecer ajustes</button></div></details>`:'';
  const mapControl=labelType!=='PRODUCTO'?`<div class="label-map-primary"><div><span class="eyebrow">SELECCIÓN VISUAL</span><b>Seleccionar desde mapa de racks</b></div><button id="label-map-open" class="primary" type="button">▦ Seleccionar desde mapa</button></div>`:'';
  const locationFilters=labelType==='UBICACION'?`<div class="label-filter-row"><label>Rack<select id="label-rack"><option value="">Todos los racks</option>${racks.map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}" ${rackFilter===r.id?'selected':''}>${esc(r.name||r.id)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>Módulo<select id="label-module" ${rackFilter?'':'disabled'}><option value="">Todos los módulos</option>${mods.map(m=>`<option value="${m}" ${String(moduleFilter)===String(m)?'selected':''}>Módulo ${m}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div>`:'';
  return `<section class="panel label-controls"><div class="label-controls-top">${typeControl}${searchControl}${operatorMode?'':formatControl+darknessControl}</div>${mapControl}${locationFilters}${operatorPrintSettings}</section>`;
}
function operatorWorkspaceHtml(){
  const sourceTitle=labelType==='RACK'&&rackFilter?'Posiciones del rack':labelType==='PRODUCTO'?'Productos / resultados':'Selección / resultados';
  return `<div class="label-workspace label-operator-workspace"><details class="label-operator-section" id="label-operator-source" open><summary><span>${esc(sourceTitle)}</span><b id="label-source-summary-count">Ver / ocultar</b></summary><section class="panel" id="label-source-slot">${sourceHtml()}</section></details><details class="label-operator-section" id="label-operator-queue"><summary><span>Etiqueta preparada</span><b id="label-queue-summary-count">${totalLabels()} lista${totalLabels()===1?'':'s'}</b></summary><section class="panel label-queue-panel" id="label-queue-slot">${queueHtml()}</section></details></div>`;
}
function wireOperatorSections(){
  const source=document.querySelector('#label-operator-source'),prepared=document.querySelector('#label-operator-queue');
  if(!source||!prepared)return;
  [source,prepared].forEach(current=>current.addEventListener('toggle',()=>{
    if(!current.open)return;
    (current===source?prepared:source).open=false;
  }));
}
export function renderLabels(root,initialType=null,activeRoute='etiquetas'){if(initialType){labelType=initialType;syncVerticalOffsetForType();}ensureQueueScope();if(!canPrint()){root.innerHTML=shell('Etiquetas',`<section class="panel">${empty('Acceso restringido','No tienes habilitado el permiso para preparar e imprimir etiquetas en este centro.')}</section>`,activeRoute);wireShell();return;}applyTypeDefault(labelType);const s=site(),company=companyName(activeCompanyId(),store.data),operatorMode=isWarehouseOperator();root.innerHTML=shell('Etiquetas',`<div class="${operatorMode?'labels-operator-mode':''}"><div class="page-intro label-page-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">IMPRESIÓN Y SEÑALIZACIÓN</span><h2>Etiquetas de bodega</h2><p>Genera códigos de barras para productos, posiciones, racks y pallets del centro activo, o imprime un código específico de reemplazo.</p></div><div class="label-site-badge"><small>Empresa / centro</small><b>${esc(company)}</b><span>${esc(s?.name||s?.id||activeSiteId())}</span></div></div>${filtersHtml()}${operatorMode?operatorWorkspaceHtml():`<div class="label-workspace"><section class="panel" id="label-source-slot">${sourceHtml()}</section><section class="panel label-queue-panel" id="label-queue-slot">${queueHtml()}</section></div>`}<section class="panel label-print-bar"><div><span class="eyebrow">LISTO PARA IMPRIMIR</span><h3 id="label-print-count">${totalLabels()} etiqueta${totalLabels()===1?'':'s'} preparadas</h3><small>Revisa la vista previa antes de enviar a la impresora.</small></div><button id="labels-preview-open" class="primary" type="button" ${queue.length?'':'disabled'}>${operatorMode?'Imprimir etiqueta':'Vista previa e imprimir'}</button></section></div>`,activeRoute);wireShell();document.querySelector('#label-type').value=labelType;const columns=document.querySelector('#label-columns'),dpi=document.querySelector('#label-zebra-dpi');if(columns)columns.value=String(labelsPerRow);if(dpi)dpi.onchange=e=>{zebraDpi=Number(e.target.value);};document.querySelector('#label-type').onchange=e=>{labelType=e.target.value;syncVerticalOffsetForType();applyTypeDefault(labelType);searchText='';rackFilter='';moduleFilter='';renderLabels(root,null,activeRoute);};const search=document.querySelector('#label-search');if(search){search.oninput=e=>{searchText=e.target.value;renderDynamic(root);};search.onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();if(!addResolvedSearch(root)&&labelType==='PRODUCTO')renderDynamic(root);}};}enlazarBotonEscaner('label-search-camera','label-search',{titulo:labelType==='PRODUCTO'?'Escanear producto':'Escanear código',ayuda:labelType==='PRODUCTO'?'Apunta al código de barras del producto':'Apunta a la etiqueta que quieres imprimir',onDetectar:()=>{searchText=document.querySelector('#label-search')?.value||'';if(!addResolvedSearch(root))renderDynamic(root);},onError:m=>toast(m,'warning')});document.querySelector('#label-search-keyboard')?.addEventListener('click',e=>{const input=document.querySelector('#label-search');if(!input)return;const numeric=input.getAttribute('inputmode')==='numeric';input.setAttribute('inputmode',numeric?'text':'numeric');e.currentTarget.textContent=numeric?'123':'ABC';e.currentTarget.title=numeric?'Teclado numérico':'Teclado alfanumérico';input.blur();setTimeout(()=>{input.focus();try{input.setSelectionRange(input.value.length,input.value.length);}catch{}},10);});document.querySelector('#label-width')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{const value=Math.max(20,Math.min(300,Number(e.target.value)||100));customWidth=value;labelSize='CUSTOM';renderLabels(root,null,activeRoute);});document.querySelector('#label-height')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{const value=Math.max(15,Math.min(300,Number(e.target.value)||50));customHeight=value;labelSize='CUSTOM';renderLabels(root,null,activeRoute);});document.querySelector('#label-columns')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{labelsPerRow=Math.max(1,Math.min(4,Number(e.target.value)||1));});document.querySelector('#label-gap')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{labelGap=Math.max(0,Math.min(20,Number(e.target.value)||0));});document.querySelector('#label-vexhora-brand')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{showVexhoraBrand=!!e.target.checked;});document.querySelector('#label-content-scale')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{const value=Math.max(1.6,Math.min(2.4,Number(e.target.value||160)/100));labelContentScale=value;const out=document.querySelector('#label-scale-value');if(out)out.textContent=`${Math.round(value*100)} %`;saveLabelCalibration();});document.querySelector('#label-vertical-offset')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{const value=setLabelVerticalOffset(e.target.value);const out=document.querySelector('#label-offset-value');if(out)out.textContent=`${value>0?'+':''}${value} mm`;});document.querySelector('#label-zebra-darkness')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{zebraDarkness=Math.max(28,Math.min(30,Math.round(Number(e.target.value)||30)));const out=document.querySelector('#label-darkness-value');if(out)out.textContent=`${zebraDarkness} / 30`;saveLabelCalibration();});document.querySelector('#label-calibration-reset')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{labelContentScale=1.6;setLabelVerticalOffset(0);zebraDarkness=30;saveLabelCalibration();renderLabels(root,null,activeRoute);});document.querySelector('#label-size-help')?.addEventListener('click',openSizeHelp);document.querySelector('#label-rack')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{rackFilter=e.target.value;moduleFilter='';renderLabels(root,null,activeRoute);});document.querySelector('#label-module')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{moduleFilter=e.target.value;renderDynamic(root);});document.querySelector('#label-map-open')?.addEventListener('click',()=>openMapSelector(root));const previewOpen=document.querySelector('#labels-preview-open');if(previewOpen)previewOpen.onclick=openPreview;wireDynamic(root);if(operatorMode)wireOperatorSections();}
